  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(5)/(3) + ( (1)/(1+frac{5){6}} ) - (5)/(3) \n\n**Formula Used:**\n\nFraction addition: (a)/(b) + (c)/(d) = (ad + bc)/(bd) \n\nFraction subtraction: (a)/(b) - (c)/(d) = (ad - bc)/(bd) \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n**(5)/(3) + ( (1)/(1+frac{5){6}} ) - (5)/(3) **\n\n⇒ (5)/(3) + ( (1)/(frac{11){6}} ) - (5)/(3) \n\n⇒ (5)/(3) + (6)/(11) - (5)/(3) \n\n⇒ (5)/(3) - (5)/(3) + (6)/(11) \n\n⇒ (6)/(11)\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 6/11.**",
